  "description": "A powered, staffed survey instrument for distant industrial resource deposits. Select steel, plasteel, uranium, gold or industrial components, then send a caravan to mine and haul the find. Each site is finite; repeated surveys provide a renewable expedition industry. It draws 700 W and requires two advanced precision components; initial supplies can be imported. Operator research speed scales native random discovery chances and the eight accumulated work-day guarantee. Sites have a native thirty-day arrival deadline; map generation disables that deadline, and the site retains its native eleven-day exit/removal countdown. Sites may have human defenders. It cannot deliver resources directly to the colony.",
